anges to WordPress and the APIs that your reviews are retrieved from, your plugin needs to stay up to date. Activating your license allows automatic updates from the Plugins page.":["WordPress ve yorumlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131n al\u0131nd\u0131\u011f\u0131 API'lerde s\u00fcrekli de\u011fi\u015fiklikler yap\u0131larak eklentinizin g\u00fcncel tutulmas\u0131 gerekir. Lisans\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirdi\u011finizde Eklentiler sayfas\u0131ndan otomatik g\u00fcncellemeler yap\u0131labilir."],"Receive Technical Support":["Teknik Destek Al\u0131n"],"Although we pride ourselves on creating reliable, easy-to-use products our expert support team is here to help with any questions. Activating your license key is recommended to receive efficient support.":["G\u00fcvenilir, kullan\u0131m\u0131 kolay \u00fcr\u00fcnler yaratmaktan gurur duysak da uzman destek ekibi her t\u00fcrl\u00fc sorunuza yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmak i\u00e7in burada. Etkili destek alabilmeniz i\u00e7in lisans anahtar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 etkinle\u015ftirmeniz \u00f6nerilir."],"Amazing Support Team.":["Harika Destek Ekibi."],"Having trouble using the plugin?":["Eklentiyi kullan\u0131rken sorun mu ya\u015f\u0131yorsunuz?"],"Contact our friendly support team.":["Dost canl\u0131s\u0131 destek ekibimizle ileti\u015fime ge\u00e7in."],"Go to Support Form":["Destek Formuna Git"],"Create a feed":["Bir ak\u0131\u015f olu\u015fturun"],"Dashboard":["Pano"],"Create a Review feed":["Bir Yorum ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 olu\u015fturun"],"more":[""],"Confirm":["Onayla"],"You are using the new Google Places API":[""],"New API":[""],"License Key ":["Lisans Anahtar\u0131 "],"Your ":["Sizin "]," License is ":[" Lisans\u0131n\u0131z: "],"Active":["Etkin"],"Inactive":["Devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131"],"Expired":["S\u00fcresi sona ermi\u015f"],"Manage License":["Lisans\u0131 Y\u00f6net"],"Test Connection":["Ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 Test Et"],"Connection Error":["Ba\u011flant\u0131 Hatas\u0131"],"Upgrade":["Y\u00fckselt"],"Deactivate":["Etkisizle\u015ftir"],"This source is not used by any feeds.":[""],"Are you sure you want to delete it?":[""],"feed":[""],"This source is used by":[""],"Delete ":["Sil "],"Source Deleted!":["Kaynak Silindi!"],"Select feed to export":[""],"Export":["D\u0131\u015fa Aktar"],"Original Text":["Orjinal Metin"],"Custom text\/translation":["\u00d6zel metin\/\u00e7eviri"],"Context":["\u0130\u00e7erik"],"New Reviews collected daily.":["G\u00fcnl\u00fck olarak toplanan yeni Yorumlar."],"Clearing caches will trigger a full resync of all reviews. This may take a few minutes and could temporarily slow down your site.":[""],"Clear All Caches":["T\u00fcm \u00d6nbellekleri Temizle"],"You are using the Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Eklentinin Lite s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc kullan\u0131yorsunuz-lisans gerekmiyor. Keyfini \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n! \ud83d\ude42 Daha fazla \u00f6zelli\u011fin kilidini a\u00e7mak i\u00e7in "],"Upgrading to Pro":["Pro s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcne y\u00fckseltmeyi de\u011ferlendirin"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["Lite eklenti s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fcn de\u011ferli bir kullan\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 olarak, \u00f6deme s\u0131ras\u0131nda otomatik olarak uygulanan %50 \u0130ND\u0130R\u0130M al\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z!"],"Install Pro":["Pro'yu Y\u00fckle"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["De\u011fi\u015fiklikleri Kaydet"],"Plugin Installed":["Eklenti Y\u00fcklendi"],"Unknown Error":["Bilinmeyen Hata"],"Plugin Activated":["Eklenti Etkinle\u015ftirildi"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Eklenti Devre D\u0131\u015f\u0131 B\u0131rak\u0131ld\u0131"],"About Us":["Hakk\u0131m\u0131zda"],"SmashBalloon Team":["SmashBalloon Ekibi"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Smash Balloon'da, web siteniz i\u00e7in dakikalar i\u00e7inde g\u00fczel ve duyarl\u0131 sosyal medya ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131 olu\u015fturman\u0131za yard\u0131mc\u0131 olan yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar geli\u015ftiriyoruz."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["WordPress'e sosyal medya ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131 eklemeyi s\u00fcper basit hale getirmeyi kendimize g\u00f6rev bildik. Art\u0131k karma\u015f\u0131k kurulum ad\u0131mlar\u0131, \u00e7irkin iframe widget'lar\u0131 veya negatif sayfa h\u0131z\u0131 puanlar\u0131 yok."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Eklentilerimiz sadece kullan\u0131m\u0131 kolay de\u011fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda tamamen \u00f6zelle\u015ftirilebilir, g\u00fcvenilir ve h\u0131zl\u0131! \u0130\u015fte bu y\u00fczden halihaz\u0131rda t\u0131pk\u0131 sizin gibi 1,6 milyondan fazla harika kullan\u0131c\u0131, bu eklentileri sitelerinde kullanmay\u0131 tercih etmi\u015f bulunmaktad\u0131r."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Di\u011fer Sosyal Medya Ak\u0131\u015f Eklentilerimiz"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["Biz sadece bir Yorum eklentisinden daha fazlas\u0131y\u0131z! Di\u011fer eklentilerimize g\u00f6z at\u0131n ve sitenize daha fazla i\u00e7erik ekleyin."],"Install":["Y\u00fckle"],"Installed":["Y\u00fcklendi"],"Social Wall":["Sosyal Duvar"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["T\u00fcm eklentilerimizden gelen ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131 tek bir duvarda birle\u015ftirin"],"Plugins we recommend":["\u00d6nerdi\u011fimiz eklentiler"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Yoksay"],"Search Documentation":["Belge Ara"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Daha fazla deste\u011fe mi ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z var? Yard\u0131m etmek i\u00e7in buraday\u0131z."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Bir Destek Bileti G\u00f6nderin"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["WordPress.org Forum'da Yard\u0131m Al\u0131n"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["H\u0131zl\u0131 ve g\u00fcler y\u00fczl\u00fc destek ekibimiz her zaman yard\u0131mc\u0131 olmaktan mutluluk duyar!"],"System Info":["Sistem Bilgisi"],"Collapse":["Daralt"],"Expand":["Geni\u015flet"],"Export Settings":["Ayarlar\u0131 D\u0131\u015far\u0131 Aktar"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Eklenti ayarlar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Destek ile kolayca payla\u015f\u0131n"],"Temporary Login":[""],"Our team might require temporary login access with limited access to only our plugin to help you test your issues":[""],"Create Temporary Login Link":[""],"Temporary User Created":[""],"Temporary Login link for support access created by you. This is auto-destructed 14 days after creation. To create a new link, please delete the old one.":[""],"Link":["Ba\u011flant\u0131"],"Temporary User Deleted":[""],"Please enter you business name as it is in Google":[""],"Business name to search for Place ID":[""],"Business ID found":[""],"Clear Log":[""],"Code":[""],"Details":[""],"Moderate review feeds":["Yorum ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131n\u0131 denetle"],"Display images and videos":["G\u00f6rselleri ve videolar\u0131 g\u00f6ster"],"Upsell Modal Icon":["Sat\u0131\u015f Y\u00fckseltme Modal Simgesi"],"And get much more!":["Ve \u00e7ok daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 elde edin!"],"Add reviews to your collection":[""],"Organize reviews into collections, embed collections on any page":[""],"Collections help you organize your reviews in collections such as \u201cHomepage reviews\u201d or \u201cProduct reviews\u201d. You can then use them as a reviews source in any feed.":[""],"Add your first review to this collection":[""],"Add reviews from Google, Facebook, TrustPilot or Yelp. Collections help you hand-pick reviews and embed them on pages.":[""],"Create handpicked reviews collections to make the best first impression.":[""],"Or get them from your audience":[""],"You can also connect a form from WPForms or Formidable forms.":[""],"Add these collections as source on any feed. These work just like any other sources.":[""],"Name your Collection":[""],"Eg. Homepage Reviews":[""],"What are collections?":[""],"By duplicating this collection, all the reviews created and added to this collection will be duplicated too!":[""],"By deleting this collection, all the reviews created and added for it will be deleted too":[""],"Empty Collections Icon":[""],"Create collections of handpicked reviews to showcase them on your website, reviews page or product page":[""],"Okay, got it":[""],"Refresh List":[""],"No reviews found!":[""],"Add the review by manually typing it out":[""],"Or Add from existing source":[""],"Add the review from an existing source you have already connected":[""],"Select Reviewer Avatar Image":[""],"Use this media":[""],"Add Image to Review":[""],"You are about to edit this review":[""],"This review is displayed in":[""],"feeds. Editing it will change it on both those places. This action is irreversible.":[""],"User Avatar":[""],"Add Reviewer Image":[""],"Remove reviewer image":[""],"Rate %d star":[""],"Rate %d stars":[""],"First Name":[""],"J